| # | Area | Priority | Files | Est. lines saved |
|---|------|----------|-------|-----------------|
| 1 | `_run_tool` → `tool_context` | High | 1 | ~20 |
| 2 | Hardcoded excludes → `FilePatterns` | High | 8 | ~40 |
